    "detailed_description": "Space Warrior: Dark Warrior of Space<br />\r\n<br />\r\nSpace Warrior invites you to a dangerous and exciting space adventure in which you fight against hordes of hostile aliens. In this fast paced 2D survival game, you will have to use your skills and strategy to survive and save the galaxy.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nDeep in space, ruthless aliens have invaded your galaxy. You, as a chosen space warrior, are the last hope to stand up to these invading forces and protect your home. Equipped with a variety of weapons and upgrades, you will launch into space to defeat waves of enemies and uncover the dark secrets of space.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nEach level presents unique challenges and obstacles. You must avoid asteroid fields, hide from enemy ships and face relentless alien creatures. Along the way, collect power-ups and bonuses that will help you survive and succeed in your mission. Become the dark warrior of space and determine the fate of the galaxy.",
